WEBVTT

00:11.950 --> 00:14.360
Didn't you hear me, boy?

00:14.360 --> 00:16.820
Those kids are my merchandise!

00:17.480 --> 00:20.950
You need to give them back to me!
 Hand them over right now!

00:22.130 --> 00:23.310
Merchandise?

00:24.410 --> 00:25.320
<i>Appraise.</i>

00:26.510 --> 00:27.770
<i>A slave trader?!</i>

00:28.390 --> 00:30.380
Didn't you hear me, boy?!

00:36.460 --> 00:37.760
It's okay.

00:39.060 --> 00:41.640
These two are my brother and sister.

00:41.640 --> 00:43.560
Please don't be so rude.

00:43.560 --> 00:45.460
I don't think so!

00:45.460 --> 00:48.900
There's no way I'd mistake a 
pair of kids as unique as them!

00:52.990 --> 00:56.300
<i>Judging from how things looked 
when I found them in the forest,</i>

00:56.820 --> 01:03.100
<i>he probably tossed Alan and Elena out 
as bait to save himself from monsters.</i>

01:05.070 --> 01:08.570
<i>Slavery does exist in Etelldia.</i>

01:09.350 --> 01:14.260
<i>Slaves are marked with contract 
magic to prove their status,</i>

01:14.580 --> 01:16.540
<i>but Alan and Elena don't have any such marks.</i>

01:17.220 --> 01:21.710
<i>No, just taking little kids like 
them as slaves is inexcusable.</i>

01:23.880 --> 01:25.680
Could you please stop talking nonsense?

01:25.680 --> 01:29.600
Shut up! I said hand them over right now!

01:29.600 --> 01:33.420
<i>This asshole... Maybe I'll 
just pulverize him right now.</i>

01:42.330 --> 01:48.620
<b>A Journey Through Another World: 
Raising Kids While Adventuring</b>

03:04.450 --> 03:09.460
<b>The Ocean! It's Salty!</b>

03:08.720 --> 03:10.210
<i>Just calm down.</i>

03:10.210 --> 03:13.630
<i>What I need to do right 
now isn't beat him up.</i>

03:14.560 --> 03:16.650
<i>I need to protect Alan and Elena.</i>

03:18.840 --> 03:21.000
Hey! What's going on here?

03:21.000 --> 03:23.260
<i>The patrol? Perfect timing.</i>

03:23.490 --> 03:27.530
This boy's a thief! He stole my merchandise!

03:27.530 --> 03:29.480
Arrest him at once!

03:29.480 --> 03:30.390
Is this true?

03:30.680 --> 03:33.730
No. I've done no such thing.

03:34.160 --> 03:37.840
What are you doing?! 
Just arrest him already!

03:37.840 --> 03:41.650
What do you think it is 
that he claims I stole?

03:42.030 --> 03:43.860
What merchandise was stolen from you?

03:43.860 --> 03:45.450
Those kids!

03:45.710 --> 03:48.150
You're calling these children "merchandise"?

03:48.150 --> 03:50.470
That's what I keep saying!

03:50.470 --> 03:51.460
But...

03:51.800 --> 03:53.470
Where's your proof, then?

03:53.470 --> 03:55.590
If you insist these two are your slaves,

03:55.590 --> 03:57.230
let's see you prove it!

03:57.230 --> 03:58.420
What?!

03:58.780 --> 04:02.840
Just so we're clear, they don't 
have the marks of slaves on them.

04:02.840 --> 04:04.890
Hmph! That's...

04:04.890 --> 04:07.470
You falsely claimed they were slaves

04:07.470 --> 04:10.270
in an attempt to kidnap them!
 <i>You're</i> the criminal!

04:13.040 --> 04:14.050
Takumi?

04:15.330 --> 04:16.820
Did something happen here?

04:17.560 --> 04:19.830
Let me go, damn it!

04:18.540 --> 04:19.830
Just come along.

04:19.830 --> 04:22.030
You can talk all you want at the station.

04:26.580 --> 04:28.360
Thank you.

04:28.360 --> 04:31.520
The two of you really saved us.

04:31.520 --> 04:34.780
Nah, we only came to see you guys off.

04:34.780 --> 04:40.560
We have testified that these two are,
 without a doubt, your siblings.

04:40.560 --> 04:43.540
They'll never be labeled as slaves again.

04:44.400 --> 04:45.960
Taku...

04:47.180 --> 04:48.670
It's okay.

04:48.670 --> 04:54.310
So long as you two want to stay 
with me, I'll be right here.

04:57.940 --> 04:59.080
Okay...

05:06.280 --> 05:07.990
Here, Takumi. For you.

05:07.990 --> 05:09.280
What is it?

05:09.280 --> 05:11.710
An invitation for the 
provincial lord of Bailey.

05:11.710 --> 05:12.450
Huh?

05:12.720 --> 05:15.000
I'm acquainted with Bailey's lord.

05:15.000 --> 05:19.190
I've contacted him, so when you 
arrive in town, please go see him.

05:19.190 --> 05:23.910
Feel free to make him clean up any messes 
you come across, or anything else you need.

05:23.910 --> 05:24.920
Uh...

05:25.160 --> 05:26.960
A-All right.

05:26.960 --> 05:29.680
If we run into any trouble, 
I'll seek his help.

05:30.050 --> 05:31.850
Please do so.

05:31.850 --> 05:34.760
If you're ever in Shireen again, come see us.

05:34.760 --> 05:35.600
Sure.

05:36.270 --> 05:37.720
Well, ready to go?

05:37.720 --> 05:38.640
Uh-huh...

05:38.640 --> 05:40.800
Come on, cheer up.

05:40.800 --> 05:44.110
Let's say goodbye to Sir Vault 
and Sir Risner, okay?

05:44.840 --> 05:46.530
Goodbye.

05:46.830 --> 05:48.660
No need to force them.

05:48.660 --> 05:51.020
They just had a scary experience, after all.

05:51.020 --> 05:55.500
Yeah. Just be happy and full of 
energy again next time we meet!

05:55.760 --> 05:57.720
Thank you.

05:57.720 --> 06:00.210
Well, we'll be going now. Take care.

06:09.550 --> 06:12.230
<i>How can I cheer them up?</i>

06:13.300 --> 06:14.350
I know!

06:14.350 --> 06:16.780
Let's pass through the Forest of Gaia.

06:25.360 --> 06:26.920
No one's here.

06:26.920 --> 06:29.700
Okay, you guys can come out.

06:33.350 --> 06:34.660
Oh! Joule!

06:34.660 --> 06:36.200
Feat! Bolt!

06:36.200 --> 06:37.970
Good boy.

06:37.970 --> 06:39.920
<i>I missed you, Taku!</i>

06:40.200 --> 06:43.130
<i>Alan, Elena! Have you been doing good?</i>

06:43.130 --> 06:44.630
Uh... Yeah.

06:44.980 --> 06:47.840
<i>What's wrong? Did something happen?</i>

06:48.230 --> 06:52.290
Joule and Feat, we'd like you 
to let us ride on your backs.

06:52.290 --> 06:54.350
It'll be a long trip, though. Is that okay?

06:54.350 --> 06:55.520
<i>Of course!</i>

06:55.520 --> 06:56.560
<i>Leave it to us!</i>

06:56.900 --> 07:00.980
Bolt, fly overhead and let me 
know if you see anyone around.

07:00.980 --> 07:02.520
<i>Got it, Chief!</i>

07:02.880 --> 07:06.590
If anyone sees us riding 
around on S-rank monsters,

07:06.590 --> 07:08.780
it could cause a bit of a fuss.

07:10.090 --> 07:11.410
Okay, let's go.

07:11.410 --> 07:12.320
<i>Okay!</i>

07:11.410 --> 07:12.320
<i>Right!</i>

07:20.540 --> 07:21.540
That's...

07:22.560 --> 07:24.040
a Bloody Bear!

07:24.390 --> 07:27.250
<i>Taku, let us take care of this.</i>

07:27.250 --> 07:28.510
Okay, go for it.

07:36.250 --> 07:37.390
In just one blow...

07:37.670 --> 07:40.350
Man, my critters are so strong.

07:40.350 --> 07:41.360
Over there!

07:41.360 --> 07:42.640
Another one!

07:45.120 --> 07:46.310
<i>Got 'im!</i>

07:46.310 --> 07:47.740
Welcome back!

07:47.740 --> 07:49.190
<i>Praise me! Praise me!</i>

07:49.190 --> 07:50.240
<i>Me, too!</i>

07:50.240 --> 07:52.800
Good girl. Good girl.

07:50.240 --> 07:52.800
Good boy. Good boy.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.910
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

07:53.910 --> 07:54.660
<i>Yay!</i>

07:55.750 --> 07:56.870
Hang on a sec!

07:56.870 --> 07:58.310
Don't do that!

07:58.310 --> 08:01.350
You guys bit those Bloody Bears, didn't you?

08:01.350 --> 08:02.830
Your mouths are dirty now.

08:03.070 --> 08:03.810
<i>Oh...</i>

08:04.290 --> 08:06.860
I'll clean you up. Just hold still.

08:07.460 --> 08:08.540
Washing!

08:11.040 --> 08:12.820
<i>Wow, I'm clean now!</i>

08:12.820 --> 08:14.340
<i>Let's try that again!</i>

08:15.910 --> 08:17.050
That tickles!

08:18.010 --> 08:20.020
C'mon, that tickles!

08:20.410 --> 08:23.000
<i>I'm so glad they're both feeling better.</i>

08:25.380 --> 08:28.860
<i>We made it through the 
Forest of Gaia by sundown</i>

08:29.320 --> 08:30.920
<i>and then set up camp.</i>

08:37.320 --> 08:39.740
Alan, Elena, what do you want to eat?

08:41.750 --> 08:43.250
Cream bread!

08:43.250 --> 08:47.160
Uh... Cream bread isn't really dinner.

08:47.160 --> 08:49.540
Let's have that as a snack 
or tomorrow's breakfast.

08:49.540 --> 08:50.730
Okay!

08:50.730 --> 08:51.960
So obedient. Very good.

08:52.220 --> 08:54.680
Let's see... How about oyakodon?

08:54.990 --> 08:55.850
Oyako...

08:55.850 --> 08:56.750
...don?

08:56.750 --> 08:59.010
It's rice with egg on top of it.

08:59.010 --> 09:00.140
On top?!

09:00.940 --> 09:02.370
That's funny!

09:02.370 --> 09:03.600
I want some!

09:03.870 --> 09:06.430
Egg on top! Egg on top!

09:06.430 --> 09:07.690
<i>Hey...</i>

09:07.690 --> 09:09.540
<i>I want some of that, too!</i>

09:09.540 --> 09:11.160
<i>Me, too!</i>

09:11.160 --> 09:12.150
<i>And me, please!</i>

09:12.400 --> 09:15.670
What? You guys want oyakodon, too?

09:15.670 --> 09:18.620
Okay, got it. Let's all have oyakodon.

09:21.580 --> 09:24.790
<b>Steamy</b>

09:21.580 --> 09:24.790
<b>Steamy</b>

09:21.850 --> 09:24.790
Ta-da! The oyakodon's done!

09:25.140 --> 09:26.300
Not what I expected.

09:26.300 --> 09:28.020
There's no egg on top.

09:28.020 --> 09:28.710
Huh?

09:29.200 --> 09:30.750
We'll eat it, though!

09:31.020 --> 09:33.060
<i>Let's eat!</i>

09:39.320 --> 09:40.490
Oh, yeah.

09:40.490 --> 09:44.270
if you ate it in your big forms, 
you'd be done in one bite.

09:47.540 --> 09:48.980
Yummy!

09:49.290 --> 09:50.820
Glad to hear it.

09:57.620 --> 10:01.460
<i>It's been a while since I looked 
up at the night sky like this.</i>

10:01.460 --> 10:04.370
<i>I've camped out a lot
since I came to this world,</i>

10:04.370 --> 10:07.190
<i>but it was always in the 
forest, or in a labyrinth.</i>

10:08.640 --> 10:09.330
Oh...

10:09.880 --> 10:10.870
The moons...

10:12.380 --> 10:17.060
<i>Etelldia has three moons: a red one, 
a yellow one, and a blue one.</i>

10:17.550 --> 10:21.370
<i>The red and yellow ones are 
visible this time of year.</i>

10:21.800 --> 10:24.720
<i>This really is another world...</i>

10:26.040 --> 10:28.210
It's been two months since I came here, huh?

10:29.680 --> 10:31.910
So much has happened,

10:31.910 --> 10:34.070
it feels like it's been no time at all.

10:46.370 --> 10:47.830
It's morning!

10:48.560 --> 10:52.040
<i>After a simple breakfast, 
we got moving quickly.</i>

10:52.480 --> 10:53.480
<i>And then...</i>

10:56.530 --> 10:57.600
<i>The ocean!</i>

11:05.180 --> 11:08.390
Alan, Elena, this is the ocean.

11:08.390 --> 11:09.730
Wow!

11:09.730 --> 11:11.600
It's so big!

11:12.390 --> 11:14.170
The water's over there!

11:14.640 --> 11:16.240
Now it's over here!

11:18.780 --> 11:20.100
<i>They seem so happy.</i>

11:20.100 --> 11:23.280
<i>Oh, yeah. It's their first time 
seeing the ocean, isn't it?</i>

11:23.560 --> 11:27.050
Alan, Elena, all this water is salty.

11:27.050 --> 11:28.240
Salty?

11:28.240 --> 11:29.280
Is it yummy?

11:29.280 --> 11:31.020
I wouldn't call it yummy.

11:31.020 --> 11:32.540
Don't drink it, okay?

11:33.710 --> 11:35.420
It sure is pretty.

11:43.280 --> 11:44.660
Taku!

11:46.070 --> 11:47.220
Can we drink it?

11:47.220 --> 11:51.170
Um, I did just tell you not to...

11:51.170 --> 11:53.040
Are you that curious about the water?

11:53.040 --> 11:54.070
Uh-huh.

11:54.070 --> 11:57.770
Okay, you can just dip a finger 
in it and taste it, then.

12:05.800 --> 12:07.370
Salty!

12:08.280 --> 12:09.770
Aren't you glad you didn't drink it?

12:10.570 --> 12:12.340
<i>I wanna play, too!</i>

12:12.340 --> 12:15.290
<i>They're really enjoying their 
first visit to the ocean.</i>

12:15.290 --> 12:17.000
<i>I'm glad I brought them here.</i>

12:17.000 --> 12:18.160
Um...

12:18.160 --> 12:22.010
Huh? I thought I just heard a voice...

12:23.510 --> 12:26.140
Um, over here.

12:32.390 --> 12:34.550
<i>What?! Is she drowning?!</i>

12:34.550 --> 12:35.730
I-I'll save you right now!

12:36.000 --> 12:37.440
Inventory!

12:36.940 --> 12:37.440
Inv\h\h\h\htory

12:38.020 --> 12:40.980
Let's see... Did I have, like, 
a lifesaver or anything?

12:40.980 --> 12:42.090
Um...

12:42.090 --> 12:43.910
H-Hang on just a second!

12:43.910 --> 12:46.170
Are you Sir Takumi?

12:46.170 --> 12:47.700
Yes, that's right! I'm Takumi—

12:48.150 --> 12:49.160
Huh?

12:49.500 --> 12:51.570
It's a pleasure to meet you.

12:51.570 --> 12:54.790
I am Millena the mermaid.

12:55.190 --> 12:56.370
Mermaid?!

12:57.040 --> 13:00.090
Status

12:57.040 --> 13:00.090
m 0 0 l 330 0 l 330 280 l 0 280

12:57.040 --> 13:00.090
Name: Millena 
Race: Mermaid 
Job: ------ 
Age: 26 
Level: 17 
Skills: Spearmanship, Water magic, 
Dismantle, Night Vision, Detect,
 Swim, Cultivate, Cooking, Singing, 
Mental resistance

12:57.330 --> 13:00.090
<i>Wow, she really is a mermaid.</i>

13:00.090 --> 13:03.590
<i>So... do her feet turn into a 
fin when she's in the water?</i>

13:03.590 --> 13:08.550
A certain retainer of the 
water god told me about you.

13:08.870 --> 13:11.660
Huh? A retainer of the water god?

13:11.660 --> 13:16.020
<i>The one who sent me Joule and 
all those items through Syl?</i>

13:16.020 --> 13:17.610
Taku!

13:17.610 --> 13:18.470
Huh?

13:18.470 --> 13:19.490
Who's that?

13:19.490 --> 13:20.860
She's a mermaid.

13:21.210 --> 13:22.620
A mermaid?

13:22.620 --> 13:24.800
Did the ocean eat her?

13:24.800 --> 13:27.360
I think she lives in the ocean.

13:28.130 --> 13:29.780
Hello.

13:30.080 --> 13:33.340
Hello there. You are Alan and Elena, yes?

13:33.340 --> 13:34.750
I have heard of you.

13:34.750 --> 13:35.530
She knows us?!

13:35.530 --> 13:36.370
How?!

13:37.210 --> 13:41.840
Um... And how does a retainer 
of the water god know me?

13:42.130 --> 13:49.050
We have been advised that you can help 
us with the problem we currently face.

13:49.740 --> 13:54.610
Sir Takumi, could you 
please lend us your aid?

13:55.790 --> 13:58.980
Um, I'm not sure what "aid" I can give...

13:58.980 --> 14:03.530
For starters, could you 
accompany me to our village?

14:03.530 --> 14:05.570
We can discuss more there.

14:05.570 --> 14:06.860
Your village?

14:07.330 --> 14:08.910
Wait a moment.

14:08.910 --> 14:13.200
I'm guessing your village is... 
under the water, right?

14:13.200 --> 14:14.200
Yes!

14:14.200 --> 14:15.580
Now, let us go!

14:15.580 --> 14:18.190
Whoa, whoa! I can't go underwater!

14:19.320 --> 14:22.580
We can't breathe underwater.

14:22.580 --> 14:24.880
<i>Also, I can't swim!</i>

14:27.760 --> 14:30.860
<i>Even back in Japan, I couldn't swim.</i>

14:32.030 --> 14:34.650
<i>I'm pretty sure I know how to do it,</i>

14:34.650 --> 14:36.500
<i>but I just lack the athletic ability.</i>

14:36.500 --> 14:38.270
<i>I'm sinking!</i>

14:39.720 --> 14:40.690
<i>Hang on...</i>

14:41.140 --> 14:44.120
<i>Syl raised a bunch of my stats for me, so...</i>

14:44.930 --> 14:47.730
<i>Maybe I'll be able to swim now?</i>

14:49.420 --> 14:51.550
<i>As for Alan and Elena,</i>

14:51.550 --> 14:55.120
<i>I feel like they could master swimming 
the first time they tried it.</i>

14:55.450 --> 14:58.830
Oh, you need not worry about breathing.

14:59.080 --> 15:01.230
I have these for you.

15:04.780 --> 15:06.500
Y-You're so far away...

15:06.860 --> 15:08.700
Please wait just a moment.

15:14.990 --> 15:16.640
Bracelets?

15:18.600 --> 15:27.070
Mermaid Bracelet

15:18.600 --> 15:27.070
A bracelet made with mermaid 
scales. Allows the wearer to 
breathe underwater.

15:18.600 --> 15:27.070
m 0 0 l 300 0 l 300 70 l 0 70

15:18.600 --> 15:27.070
Creates a thin film over the 
wearer's entire body so they 
will not get wet.

15:18.600 --> 15:27.070
m 0 0 l 280 0 l 280 70 l 0 70

15:18.860 --> 15:20.770
"Mermaid Bracelet."

15:20.770 --> 15:23.600
"A bracelet made with mermaid scales."

15:23.600 --> 15:27.070
"Allows the wearer to breathe underwater."

15:27.360 --> 15:32.030
"Creates a thin film over the wearer's 
entire body so they will not get wet."

15:32.450 --> 15:35.160
Yeah, we might actually 
be okay if we have these.

15:35.160 --> 15:35.990
Now, then...

15:36.330 --> 15:40.810
I do want to see a mermaid 
village, so I don't mind going,

15:40.810 --> 15:44.460
but I don't know if I'll be able 
to solve your problem or not.

15:44.460 --> 15:48.170
Oh, that's all right! Please come and see us!

15:48.540 --> 15:52.420
Okay, Joule, Feat, and Bolt, 
could you go back into my shadow?

15:57.360 --> 16:00.060
Alan, Elena, put these on.

16:02.770 --> 16:03.790
Wow!

16:03.790 --> 16:04.730
Pretty!

16:05.080 --> 16:06.460
Are we going into the ocean?

16:06.460 --> 16:08.190
That's right. Are you scared?

16:08.190 --> 16:10.100
That sounds fun!

16:11.990 --> 16:13.880
Okay, let's go!

16:13.880 --> 16:17.300
Water! Water!

16:15.600 --> 16:18.160
Wow, it's true. I'm not getting wet.

16:18.420 --> 16:20.830
Okay, Alan, Elena, let's dive!

16:30.630 --> 16:33.070
Is your breathing all right?

16:33.070 --> 16:36.010
Oh... I was holding my 
breath by force of habit.

16:36.440 --> 16:38.480
Wait, we can talk underwater?!

16:40.300 --> 16:41.220
<i>Where are the kids?</i>

16:41.640 --> 16:43.550
Are you guys okay?

16:43.550 --> 16:45.190
This is fun!

16:45.190 --> 16:48.400
<i>It's their first time in the ocean, 
and they're already swimming.</i>

16:48.730 --> 16:50.990
<i>They really are quick learners.</i>

16:53.360 --> 16:57.500
Okay! I'll do it, too! 
Um, breaststroke? Crawl?

16:57.500 --> 16:59.570
Am I even moving forward at all?

17:01.290 --> 17:03.040
Do you think you'll be all right?

17:04.900 --> 17:06.600
You look as if you will be.

17:07.710 --> 17:10.670
<i>Whoa! She's definitely a mermaid!</i>

17:11.250 --> 17:13.110
<i>She has scales and everything...</i>

17:18.510 --> 17:21.780
<i>Oops! I was watching her 
like an animal in a zoo!</i>

17:21.780 --> 17:24.960
I-I'm great. Sorry to keep you waiting.

17:24.960 --> 17:26.700
Well, then, let us go!

17:28.290 --> 17:32.480
Millena, what sorts of 
monsters live around here?

17:32.480 --> 17:36.060
The monsters around here are things 
like Sand Crabs and Hammerfish.

17:36.060 --> 17:38.330
None of them are terribly strong.

17:38.330 --> 17:40.450
Oh, speaking of...

17:40.450 --> 17:42.250
That's a Hammerfish.

17:42.660 --> 17:45.030
<i>Looks like we could beat it pretty easily</i>

17:45.030 --> 17:47.330
<i>as long as we avoided the hammer on its head.</i>

17:47.330 --> 17:48.950
We'll beat it!

17:49.580 --> 17:51.330
<b>Kapow</b>

17:51.890 --> 17:55.300
<i>Doesn't look like being underwater 
puts them at a disadvantage.</i>

17:55.560 --> 17:56.820
Taku!

17:56.820 --> 17:58.220
A fish!

17:58.570 --> 17:59.710
Thanks.

18:01.760 --> 18:03.410
There's a weird thing!

18:03.410 --> 18:05.020
<i>Is that a Sand Crab?</i>

18:05.020 --> 18:06.730
We'll beat it!

18:07.030 --> 18:09.080
Watch for its pincers.

18:09.080 --> 18:10.610
Don't get hurt!

18:10.960 --> 18:12.610
'Kay!

18:16.110 --> 18:18.110
<b>Flatten!!</b>

18:18.100 --> 18:19.850
They certainly are strong...

18:19.850 --> 18:21.830
Yeah, I guess...

18:21.830 --> 18:23.240
What's this?

18:23.240 --> 18:25.090
It's a crab. A Sand Crab.

18:25.090 --> 18:26.040
Crab?

18:26.260 --> 18:28.470
They're tasty when you boil them up.

18:28.470 --> 18:29.750
Want to try it sometime?

18:30.040 --> 18:31.710
Yeah!

18:41.200 --> 18:42.380
Welcome.

18:45.640 --> 18:47.750
Thank you for coming to visit.

18:47.750 --> 18:50.810
This is our village.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.530
This is it?

18:53.530 --> 18:54.800
It's sparkly!

18:54.800 --> 18:55.850
Pretty!

18:55.850 --> 18:58.290
Yeah, it's very pretty.

18:59.240 --> 19:06.950
Prismarine

18:59.240 --> 19:06.950
A crystal thought to be 
formed when the ocean 
itself crystallizes.

18:59.240 --> 19:06.950
m 0 0 l 235 0 235 70 l 0 70

18:59.240 --> 19:06.950
Conceals the power of 
the ocean within.

18:59.240 --> 19:06.950
m 0 0 l 220 0 l 220 50 l 0 50

18:59.550 --> 19:01.130
"Prismarine."

19:01.130 --> 19:04.690
"A crystal thought to be formed when 
the ocean itself crystallizes."

19:04.690 --> 19:06.950
"Conceals the power of 
the ocean within," huh?

19:07.230 --> 19:11.920
We call it the Azure Palace, 
after the color of the ocean.

19:12.180 --> 19:14.480
I will show you around inside later,

19:14.480 --> 19:18.020
but first, could you accompany 
me behind the Azure Palace?

19:18.020 --> 19:19.380
Oh, sure.

19:20.330 --> 19:23.340
We have but one problem.

19:24.630 --> 19:27.350
We would like you to do something about this.

19:27.350 --> 19:28.740
What is it?

19:28.740 --> 19:30.620
It's a sunken ship.

19:31.540 --> 19:37.980
Behind this ship is the entrance 
to a cave where we grow coral,

19:38.510 --> 19:41.420
but as you can see, it's been blocked.

19:41.420 --> 19:42.640
Behind here?

19:42.640 --> 19:47.240
Yes. All the people of our village 
tried together to move it,

19:47.240 --> 19:48.770
but it won't budge.

19:49.290 --> 19:52.110
Yeah, it's stuck, all right.

19:52.110 --> 19:53.210
Yes.

19:53.210 --> 19:57.600
And just when we thought all hope was lost,

19:57.600 --> 20:02.430
the High Priestess of the Azure Palace heard 
the words of the water god's retainer.

20:02.810 --> 20:05.510
They said the one called Takumi 
could solve our problem.

20:05.510 --> 20:06.890
Me?

20:06.890 --> 20:11.140
<i>Oh, right! I could just put the 
sunken ship in my Inventory.</i>

20:12.140 --> 20:14.050
<i>It... will fit, right?</i>

20:14.870 --> 20:16.110
What do you think?

20:16.520 --> 20:19.930
Don't worry. This should 
take no time at all.

20:23.040 --> 20:24.260
Inventory!

20:32.610 --> 20:35.550
Incredible! You moved such a big ship?

20:36.170 --> 20:39.250
Sunken Ship

20:36.170 --> 20:39.250
<i>Dietlinde</i>

20:36.610 --> 20:39.250
The sunken ship <i>Dietlinde</i>.

20:39.570 --> 20:43.430
Oh, good. It looks like everyone 
on board escaped alive.

20:44.380 --> 20:45.990
Is everything okay now?

20:50.170 --> 20:51.290
Mermaids!

20:51.290 --> 20:52.390
So many!

20:53.420 --> 20:56.520
<i>I guess there are male merpeople, too...</i>

20:56.520 --> 20:59.890
Sir Takumi, thank you so much!

20:59.890 --> 21:03.740
It's all right. Don't you 
need to check on the coral?

21:03.740 --> 21:05.790
We'll go check on it.

21:05.790 --> 21:07.440
Please do so. Thank you.

21:08.030 --> 21:10.110
Is this coral important to you?

21:10.110 --> 21:13.250
Yes. It's used to make 
all sorts of medicines.

21:13.710 --> 21:17.020
In particular, it's essential
in producing the remedy

21:17.020 --> 21:19.420
for an ailment that affects mermaids,

21:19.420 --> 21:22.210
which is why we can't 
afford to lose that coral.

21:22.620 --> 21:24.530
I hope it's all right.

21:24.530 --> 21:28.080
It hasn't been very long since 
the entrance was blocked,

21:28.080 --> 21:30.080
so I'm sure it hasn't withered yet.

21:30.950 --> 21:32.670
I hope you're right.

21:33.440 --> 21:36.940
Now, I will take you to 
see the High Priestess.

21:36.940 --> 21:37.900
Okay.

21:37.900 --> 21:39.790
Alan, Elena, let's go.

21:39.790 --> 21:41.070
'Kay!

21:51.790 --> 21:56.820
High Priestess, I have brought Sir Takumi, 
Master Alan, and Miss Elena.

21:56.820 --> 21:58.420
Please enter.

21:58.420 --> 21:59.670
Pardon us.

22:03.680 --> 22:07.550
Sir Takumi, Master Alan, Miss Elena.

22:08.400 --> 22:10.380
I welcome you.

23:44.900 --> 23:49.900
<b>Next Time</b>

23:45.400 --> 23:49.900
<b>Mermaids! Dragons!</b>

23:46.110 --> 23:47.330
Mermaids!

23:47.330 --> 23:48.590
Dragons!
